msgid ""
"<p>Vorbis' audio quality is not best measured in kilobits per second, but on a "
"scale from -1 to 10 called <em>quality</em>."
"<p>For now, quality -1 is roughly equivalent to 45kbps average, 5 is roughly "
"160kbps, and 10 gives about 400kbps. Most people seeking very-near-CD-quality "
"audio encode at a quality of 5 or, for lossless stereo coupling, 6. The quality "
"3 gives, at approximately 110kbps a smaller filesize and significantly better "
"fidelity than .mp3 compression at 128kbps."
"<p><em>This explanation is based on the one from the www.vorbis.com FAQ.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Audio-Gööd vun Vorbis warrt beter nich in kB/s meten, sünnern op en Skala "
"vun 1 to 10."
"<p>Gööd \"0\" is liek to 64 kB/s, \"5\" liek to 160 kB/s, un \"10\" liek to so "
"wat as 400 kB/s. Meist CD-Gööd gifft dat denn bi en Stoop vun 5, oder för "
"Stereo-Komprimeren ahn Verlust bi Stoop 6. De Vörinstellen is \"3\" mit so wat "
"110kB/s, man beter un bannig lütter as en MP3-Komprimeren mit 128 kB/s. "
"<p><em>Disse Verkloren wöör vun de FAQ op www.vorbis.com kopeert.</em>"

